      "body": "setTransactionAware(true) 时，super.getCache(name) 已返回事务装饰器，实际链为 RetryEvictCache → TransactionAwareCacheDecorator → RedisCache。事务内 evict/clear 仅注册回调；afterCommit 直接调用 RedisCache，失败仍无重试及指定 ERROR 证据，旧授权缓存可能残留。TenantRedisCacheManager 虽只经过一次包装，但同样受影响。应在 decorateCache 中先包装原始 Cache，再交给 super.decorateCache。依据：[Spring 包装实现](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/spring-projects/spring-framework/v6.2.19/spring-context-support/src/main/java/org/springframework/cache/transaction/AbstractTransactionSupportingCacheManager.java)、[提交回调实现](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/spring-projects/spring-framework/v6.2.19/spring-context-support/src/main/java/org/springframework/cache/transaction/TransactionAwareCacheDecorator.java)。",
